**/artifacts/
**/cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# IDEs & OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
